{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496650/extras/8c73a3e89a3eb0b983d1085d40d739b5.avif?t=1773151950\" width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You are <strong>Finn Ridley</strong>, a former Special Forces operative killed in action, only to awaken inside a <strong>cosmic simulation</strong> that refuses to let you rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dragged into a twisted virtual dimension by an unknown entity, Finn is forced to fight once more through relentless trials, evolving enemies, and collapsing timelines\u2026 all for the chance to earn his eternal peace, and reclaim the one thing he desires most: <strong>his favorite ice cream flavor</strong>.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496650/extras/ea14d1946ed5c69cbbf67e7a6461941c.avif?t=1773151950\" width=1560 height=284 /></span><strong>War Flavor</strong> is a <strong>side-scrolling action platformer</strong> with tight, arcade-style combat inspired by genre legends like <strong>Contra</strong>, <strong>Metal Slug</strong>, and <strong>Blazing Chrome</strong>, but with a deadly twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Time Is Your Health</u></strong><br>There is no life bar. No extra lives.<br>Your remaining time <i>is</i> your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Abilities Cost Time</u></strong><br>Every special move, power, and tactical advantage drains precious seconds.<br>Power comes at a price\u2014and reckless play will erase you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Strategic Arcade Gameplay</u></strong><br>How you spend your time permanently alters the game\u2019s difficulty, pacing, and enemy behavior.<br>Reflexes alone won\u2019t save you,\u00a0<strong>planning and timing are everything</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496650/extras/397b8a688677131323ec7ffa00a9f8d4.poster.avif?t=1773151950\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496650/extras/397b8a688677131323ec7ffa00a9f8d4.webm?t=1773151950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496650/extras/397b8a688677131323ec7ffa00a9f8d4.mp4?t=1773151950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496650/extras/5e6090d4035eaedb5a0a62fa6037e110.avif?t=1773151950\" width=1560 height=284 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">War Flavor\u2019s enemies aren\u2019t mindless targets. Their <strong>strengths and tactics evolve</strong> alongside you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each family of monsters comes with distinct attack patterns, weaknesses, and surprises keeping you on edge from the first mission to the last boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Adapt fast or get overwhelmed.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496650/extras/48d9793955674757a826cb9685372f15.poster.avif?t=1773151950\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496650/extras/48d9793955674757a826cb9685372f15.webm?t=1773151950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496650/extras/48d9793955674757a826cb9685372f15.mp4?t=1773151950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u00a0</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496650/extras/7cf7ad390359115d354ea4c2e5dda324.avif?t=1773151950\" width=1560 height=284 /></span><strong>\ud83e\udde9 Classic Mode</strong><br><br>Experience Finn\u2019s surreal journey through <strong>8 handcrafted levels</strong>, each alternating between intense platforming stages and challenging boss fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your actions influence the story...and the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83d\udd25 Challenge Mode</strong><br><br>All <strong>9 levels</strong> in one uninterrupted run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Random modifiers. Brutal conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fail once, and the simulation resets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496650/extras/c849426183456c60d2b3b86fb80abd3a.poster.avif?t=1773151950\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496650/extras/c849426183456c60d2b3b86fb80abd3a.webm?t=1773151950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496650/extras/c849426183456c60d2b3b86fb80abd3a.mp4?t=1773151950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496650/extras/cda8fb4d42da1fe5ae313bac542088e7.avif?t=1773151950\" width=1560 height=284 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">War Flavor blends <strong>2D characters</strong>, <strong>3D low-poly environments</strong>, and <strong>pixel art effects</strong>, creating a striking arcade aesthetic reminiscent of <strong>Paper Mario-style presentation</strong>, while staying optimized for smooth performance across platforms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">backed by a high-intensity original soundtrack built for nonstop arcade action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496650/extras/79aecc82ced33ea90ef4710299f8011e.poster.avif?t=1773151950\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496650/extras/79aecc82ced33ea90ef4710299f8011e.webm?t=1773151950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496650/extras/79aecc82ced33ea90ef4710299f8011e.mp4?t=1773151950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced <strong>run and gun platformer</strong> gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original arcade-focused soundtrack designed to amplify chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique <strong>time-as-resource</strong> core mechanic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No life counter,\u00a0<strong>time replaces health</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolving enemies and adaptive difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 story levels + Challenge Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade-inspired combat with strategic depth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player and optional co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PC &amp; Console release planned</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Outsmart Time, Survive the Simulator </i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Reflexes alone won\u2019t save you <strong>strategy, timing, and resource management</strong> are the keys to survival. <br>Enter the simulation, face the chaos, and uncover the cosmic mystery behind your resurrection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496650/extras/01fb14ca1a47ccfb3fe60475b7c33d51.poster.avif?t=1773151950\" width=1170 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496650/extras/01fb14ca1a47ccfb3fe60475b7c33d51.webm?t=1773151950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496650/extras/01fb14ca1a47ccfb3fe60475b7c33d51.mp4?t=1773151950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3496650?t=1773151950","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3496650?t=1773151950","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496650/2807ac6c76ad55e513bb32abb60f318b2fda8b5f/capsule_