wist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Time Is Your Health</u></strong><br>There is no life bar. No extra lives.<br>Your remaining time <i>is</i> your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Abilities Cost Time</u></strong><br>Every special move, power, and tactical advantage drains precious seconds.<br>Power comes at a price\u2014and reckless play will erase you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Strategic Arcade Gameplay</u></strong><br>How you spend your time permanently alters the game\u2019s difficulty, pacing, and enemy behavior.<br>Reflexes alone won\u2019t save you,\u00a0<strong>planning and timing are everything</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496650/extras/397b8a688677131323ec7ffa00a9f8d4.poster.avif?t=1773151950\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496650/extras/397b8a688677131323ec7ffa00a9f8d4.webm?t=1773151950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496650/extras/397b8a688677131323ec7ffa00a9f8d4.mp4?t=1773151950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496650/extras/5e6090d4035eaedb5a0a62fa6037e110.avif?t=1773151950\" width=1560 height=284 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">War Flavor\u2019s enemies aren\u2019t mindless targets. Their <strong>strengths and tactics evolve</strong> alongside you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each family of monsters comes with distinct attack patterns, weaknesses, and surprises keeping you on edge from the first mission to the last boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Adapt fast or get overwhelmed.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496650/extras/48d9793955674757a826cb9685372f15.poster.avif?t=1773151950\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496650/extras/48d9793955674757a826cb9685372f15.webm?t=1773151950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496650/extras/48d9793955674757a826cb9685372f15.mp4?t=1773151950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u00a0</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496650/extras/7cf7ad390359115d354ea4c2e5dda324.avif?t=1773151950\" width=1560 height=284 /></span><strong>\ud83e\udde9 Classic Mode</strong><br><br>Experience Finn\u2019s surreal journey through <strong>8 handcrafted levels</strong>, each alternating between intense platforming stages and challenging boss fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your actions influence the story...and the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83d\udd25 Challenge Mode</strong><br><br>All <strong>9 levels</strong> in one uninterrupted run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Random modifiers. Brutal conditions.</p><p clas